  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "An outcome reached",
     "texto": [
      "**-고 말다** presents an outcome that was finally reached; it often expresses regret or something that happened despite expectations, but the nuance depends on the context: 잊다 → **잊고 말았어요** (I ended up forgetting it).",
      "기차를 놓치고 말았어요 = in the end I missed the train."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Completed action and reaction",
     "texto": [
      "**-아/어 버리다** presents an action as completed and can add regret, relief or another judgement: 먹다 → **먹어 버렸어요** (I ate it up / I ate it all), 잃다 → **잃어버렸어요** (I lost it). **잃어버리다** is also the everyday expression «to lose / mislay»; it does not always imply more intensity than 잃다."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
